WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.480
¿Qué?

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:04.840
What's that?

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.720
It's, a common thing.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.960
Happens a few times a week.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.080
But…

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.080
Why am I only seeing it now?

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.640
Gina, get a grip.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.800
It's over.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:20.880
You should consider organ donation.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.320
What?

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.040
She can't be saved,

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.360
but she can still

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.400
help someone else.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.320
Listen, you didn't really think

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.800
she would stand up and walk

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.880
after you said "Mom",

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.720
did you?

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:42.840
Gina, come back to reality.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.280
You should go.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.160
What?

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.240
You gotta go.
